WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.377
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.471
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:40.069
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:43.045
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, help me...my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.916
to see his smile

00:02:45.671 --> 00:02:53.635
FIRM DECISION —
"I'M TAKING MIKI AWAY FROM YOU."

00:07:35.994 --> 00:07:39.327
YUU MATSUURA

00:11:30.028 --> 00:11:32.223
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.398
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.368 --> 00:22:12.335
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.925 --> 00:22:37.860
NEW CHOICE — "YOU DON'T
HAVE TO FORGET ABOUT HIM."

00:22:53.677 --> 00:22:58.205
I found the light

00:22:58.349 --> 00:23:03.582
That cleansed my heart

00:23:03.721 --> 00:23:08.317
In the awakening sky

00:23:08.459 --> 00:23:13.920
You shine

00:23:14.064 --> 00:23:19.001
Andl know

00:23:19.136 --> 00:23:24.096
No matter how far
apart we may be

00:23:24.241 --> 00:23:29.110
We're greeting
the same dawn

00:23:29.246 --> 00:23:34.616
Aren't we?

00:23:34.752 --> 00:23:39.382
It's the brightly
glittering thread

00:23:39.523 --> 00:23:44.825
That binds our memories

00:23:44.962 --> 00:23:50.025
In the future beyond futures

00:23:50.167 --> 00:23:55.195
The gods will be there for us

00:23:55.339 --> 00:24:01.608
The gods will be there for us
